.TH PACKTIDE 1 "2026-10-06" "packtide 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
packtide \- cross-distribution package management TUI and CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B packtide
[COMMAND] [OPTIONS] [QUERY...]
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check-updates [--refresh]
Check available package updates.
.TP
.B install [QUERY...] [--refresh] [-y] [--no-ai]
Install packages through the detected backend.
.TP
.B remove [QUERY...]
Remove packages.
.TP
.B mirror-update [-c COUNTRY|--country COUNTRY]
Update the package mirror configuration.
.TP
.B downgrade [QUERY...]
Select package versions to downgrade.
.TP
.B sysup [-l|--list] [--ui-lang LANG] [--news-source SOURCE] [--count N]
Run the legacy system-update bridge to systide.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Print version.
